   "format": "mcq",
   "stem": {
      "text": "A particle moves along a line so that its velocity at time t seconds is \\( v(t) = 2 t^{2} - 14 t + 12 \\) centimeters per second. Find the exact total distance, in centimeters, that it travels over the time interval \\( 0 \\le t \\le \\frac{13}{2} \\).",
      "command_verb": "find"
   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "symbolic",
      "mathjson": [
         "Rational",
         146,
         3
      ],
      "units": "centimeters"
   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "Total distance is \\( \\int_{0}^{\\frac{13}{2}} \\left|v(t)\\right|\\,dt \\). Since \\( v(t) = 2 \\left(t - 6\\right) \\left(t - 1\\right) \\), the velocity changes sign at \\( t = 1 \\) and \\( t = 6 \\), so the interval is split there.",
         "rule_named": "total distance as the integral of speed"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "On \\( [0, 1] \\), \\( \\int_{0}^{1} v(t)\\,dt = \\frac{17}{3} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Rational",
            17,
            3
         ],
         "rule_named": "definite integral of a polynomial"
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "On \\( [1, 6] \\), \\( \\int_{1}^{6} v(t)\\,dt = - \\frac{125}{3} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Rational",
            -125,
            3
         ],
         "rule_named": "definite integral of a polynomial"
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "On \\( [6, \\frac{13}{2}] \\), \\( \\int_{6}^{\\frac{13}{2}} v(t)\\,dt = \\frac{4}{3} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Rational",
            4,
            3
         ],
         "rule_named": "definite integral of a polynomial"
      },
      {
         "step": 5,
         "text": "Add the sizes of the three pieces: the total distance is \\( \\frac{17}{3} + \\frac{125}{3} + \\frac{4}{3} = \\frac{146}{3} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Rational",
            146,
            3
         ],
         "rule_named": "sum of absolute changes"
      }
   ],
